#: rc.cpp:6
msgid "Main Toolbar"
msgstr "Barra de ferramentas Principal"

#. i18n: file: settings.kcfg:21
#. i18n: ectx: tooltip, entry (MiddleClickAction), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "The action performed on a middle-click"
msgstr "A acción realizada ao premer co botón central"

#. i18n: file: settings.kcfg:22
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (MiddleClickAction), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:12
msgid ""
"Selects the action performed when middle-clicking on the main game area. If "
"a middle mouse button is not available, this action can be performed by "
"left- and right-clicking simultaneously or by left-clicking while holding "
"the control key."
msgstr ""
"Escolle a acción que se realiza ao premer co botón central do rato na área "
"principal do xogo. Se non dispón do botón central do rato, esta acción pode "
"facerse premendo á vez cos botóns esquerdo e dereito, ou só co esquerdo pero "
"mantendo á vez premida a tecla control."

#. i18n: file: settings.kcfg:27
#. i18n: ectx: tooltip, entry (RightClickAction), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "The action performed on a right-click"
msgstr "A acción a realizar cando se preme co botón central do rato"

#. i18n: file: settings.kcfg:28
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (RightClickAction), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "Selects the action performed when right-clicking on the main game area."
msgstr ""
"Escolle a acción a realizar cando se preme co botón dereito na área "
"principal do xogo."

#. i18n: file: settings.kcfg:34
#. i18n: ectx: tooltip, entry (AnimationSpeed), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "The speed used to display animations"
msgstr "A velocidade empregada para as animacións"

#. i18n: file: settings.kcfg:35
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (AnimationSpeed), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:24
msgid "Adjusts the speed at which the in game animations are displayed."
msgstr "Axusta a velocidade coa que se mostran as animacións do xogo."

#. i18n: file: settings.kcfg:39
#. i18n: ectx: tooltip, entry (PreventUnsafeMoves), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:27
msgid "Prevent the player from making fatal moves"
msgstr "Evita que o xogador faga movimentos mortais"

#. i18n: file: settings.kcfg:40
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (PreventUnsafeMoves), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:30
msgid ""
"If checked, the game will ignore any move that would result in the immediate "
"death of the hero (other than random teleports and waiting out the round)."
msgstr ""
"Se sinala esta opción, a partida ignorará calquera movimento que cause a "
"morte imediata do heroi, excepto as teleportacións aleatorias e o pasar a "
"vez."

#. i18n: file: settings.kcfg:46
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (Ruleset), group (Rules)
#: rc.cpp:33
msgid "Selects the set of game rules to be used in the next game."
msgstr "Escolle as regras a utilizar na seguinte partida."

#. i18n: file: settings.kcfg:53
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (Theme), group (Theme)
#: rc.cpp:36
msgid "Selects the theme used to display all in game elements."
msgstr "Escolle o tema utilizado para mostrar todos os elementos do xogo."

